# QuantAI — Cursor IDE Invariants & Agent Rules

# Canonical Guide: AGENTS.md

- Pure platform CSS only using `@layer dl-*` and `@yuva-devlab/tokens`. Never use or introduce utility-first CSS frameworks.
- Zero hardcoded strings: Import user-visible copy from `src/lib/ui-copy/`.
- Enums over raw string unions: Import from `src/constants/`.
- Maximum file length: 250 lines. Deconstruct at 200 lines.
- 100% JSDoc on all exported symbols.
- Never commit or push without explicit user instruction.
- Run `pnpm typecheck` and `pnpm lint` to verify all modifications.
